```puml
@startuml Dental_Clinic_Use_Cases  
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor Patient
actor Dentist
actor Receptionist

rectangle "Dental Clinic System" {
    usecase "Book Appointment" as UC1
    usecase "Cancel/Reschedule" as UC2
    usecase "View Treatment Plan" as UC3
    usecase "Record Clinical Notes" as UC4
    usecase "Update Dental Chart" as UC5
    usecase "Manage Schedules" as UC6
    usecase "Process Payments" as UC7
    usecase "Generate Invoices" as UC8
}

Patient --> UC1
Patient --> UC2
Patient --> UC3

Receptionist --> UC1
Receptionist --> UC2
Receptionist --> UC6
Receptionist --> UC7
Receptionist --> UC8

Dentist --> UC3
Dentist --> UC4
Dentist --> UC5
Dentist --> UC6

@enduml
```